      "h1": "Marini Big Driller",
      "description": "Big Driller is an oleopneumatic drilling unit for large-diameter holes (255 mm) used for so-called blind cuts. It has a hydraulic rotary head and is powered by a hydraulic power pack with a 17 kW dies",
      "blocks": [
