          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Big Driller is an oleopneumatic drilling unit for large-diameter holes (255 mm) used for so-called blind cuts. It has a hydraulic rotary head and is powered by a hydraulic power pack with a 17 kW diesel or petrol engine or a 15 kW electric motor.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Sturdy structure for drilling in various directions. The CID 120 drilling slide takes extension rods of 1,200 mm and carries the ID 300 rotary head. Holes are drilled with a 6-inch down-the-hole (DTH) hammer with a 255 mm button bit. A base frame anchors the unit to the ground, and a hydraulic control panel runs feed and rotation while the hammer is controlled pneumatically.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Feed stroke: 1,260 mm",
            "Rotary torque: 3,000 Nm",
            "Hole diameter: 255 mm",
            "Engine: 17 kW / 15 kW"
